              "name": "adwillard"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Instead of adding ice cubes, try freezing the watermelon and then blend with papaya, &amp; honey. I keep zip loc bags of cubed watermelon in my freezer. I take one out to defrost a little while I'm getting ready for work. For a variation, I sometimes blend it with slices of mango or strawberries! (the ice just waters it down)"
