              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Maia Reim"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was so great.... refreshing and restorative. I added a couple teaspoons of fresh lemon juice for added tang. It was a great way to use up a rather insipid watermelon. Of note: my husband was badly depleted after throwing up and 4 oz of this perked him right up, settling his stomach and found him wanting more.",
